# Lillian Turner Portfolio - Design System Style Guide

## 🎨 Color Palette

### Primary Colors (Green Theme)
- **Primary**: `hsl(158, 64%, 20%)` - Forest green, main brand color
- **Primary Foreground**: `hsl(0, 0%, 100%)` - White text on primary backgrounds
- **Deep Forest Green**: `hsl(158, 85%, 9%)` - Dark green for emphasized text
- **Accent**: `hsl(158, 64%, 35%)` - Lighter green for accents

### Secondary Colors (Orange Theme - Technical Writing)
- **Orange**: `hsl(25, 95%, 53%)` - Bright orange
- **Orange Foreground**: `hsl(25, 60%, 25%)` - Muted darkish orange for text

### Tertiary Colors (Yellow Theme - Design Gallery)
- **Yellow**: `hsl(45, 93%, 47%)` - Bright yellow
- **Yellow Foreground**: `hsl(25, 30%, 25%)` - Dark warm brown for text

### Neutral Colors
- **Background**: `hsl(0, 0%, 100%)` - White
- **Foreground**: `hsl(158, 85%, 9%)` - Deep forest green for body text
- **Muted**: `hsl(210, 40%, 96.1%)` - Light gray backgrounds
- **Muted Foreground**: `hsl(215.4, 16.3%, 46.9%)` - Gray text

### Decorative Colors (Hero Section Blobs)
- **Blue**: `hsl(210, 100%, 70%)` - Soft blue
- **Lavender**: `hsl(270, 50%, 75%)` - Soft purple
- **Light Green**: `hsl(120, 40%, 80%)` - Soft green
- **Peach**: `hsl(25, 80%, 75%)` - Soft peach

## 📐 Layout & Spacing

### Container
- Max width: Responsive container with padding
- Padding: `px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8`

### Section Spacing
- Padding: `py-20` (80px top and bottom)
- Consistent across all major sections

### Grid Systems
- **Two-column**: `lg:grid-cols-2` for hero and major content
- **Three-column**: `md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3` for portfolio cards
- **Four-column**: `grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4` for core values
- Gap: `gap-6` (24px) standard, `gap-8` (32px) for larger layouts

## 🔤 Typography

### Font Family
- Primary: System font stack (default)

### Headings
- **H1**: `text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold` - Main page title
- **H2**: `text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4` - Section headings
- **H3**: `text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold` - Subsection headings
- **H4**: `text-xl font-semibold` - Card headings

### Body Text
- **Base**: `text-base` (16px)
- **Large**: `text-lg` (18px) for emphasis
- **Small**: `text-sm` (14px) for metadata

### Text Colors
- **Primary text**: `text-foreground` or `text-primary`
- **Secondary text**: `text-muted-foreground` or `text-foreground/70`
- **Accent text**: `text-orange-foreground` or `text-yellow-foreground` in themed sections

### Special Typography
- **Subheading**: `.subheading` class - Uppercase with letter spacing

