1. **Primary (Green)**
```tsx
<Button variant="default" className="bg-primary hover:bg-primary/90 text-primary-foreground btn-animate hover-glow">
  Button Text
</Button>
```

2. **Orange**
```tsx
<Button variant="orange" className="bg-orange hover:bg-orange/90 text-orange-foreground btn-animate hover-glow">
  Button Text
</Button>
```

3. **Yellow**
```tsx
<Button variant="yellow" className="bg-yellow hover:bg-yellow/90 text-yellow-foreground btn-animate hover-glow">
  Button Text
</Button>
```

4. **Outline**
```tsx
<Button variant="outline" className="border-2 border-primary text-primary hover:bg-primary/10 btn-animate">
  Button Text
</Button>
```

5. **Ghost**
```tsx
<Button variant="ghost" className="text-primary hover:bg-primary/10">
  Button Text
</Button>
```

#### Sizes
- **Small**: `size="sm"` - `h-9 px-3`
- **Default**: `size="default"` - Standard size
- **Large**: `size="lg"` - `h-11 px-8` for CTAs

### Cards

#### Glass Cards
- **Green (Primary)**: `.glass-card-primary`
- **Orange**: `.glass-card-orange`
- **Yellow**: `.glass-card-yellow`

#### Properties
- Backdrop blur: `backdrop-blur-sm`
- Background: Semi-transparent with color tint
- Border: Solid color with transparency
- Border radius: `rounded-xl` or `rounded-2xl`
- Padding: `p-6` or `p-8`

#### Glass Buttons
- Used for Core Values cards
- Variants: `.glass-button-primary`, `.glass-button-orange`, `.glass-button-yellow`

### Modals (Dialog)

#### Structure
```tsx
<Dialog>
  <DialogContent className="max-w-5xl max-h-[85vh]">
    <DialogHeader>
      <DialogTitle>Project Title</DialogTitle>
    </DialogHeader>
    <div className="overflow-y-scroll">
      {/* Modal content */}
    </div>
  </DialogContent>
</Dialog>
```

#### Scrollbar Styling
- Technical Writing modals: Orange scrollbar
- Custom styling with `data-theme` attribute

### Navigation

#### Header
- Fixed: `fixed top-0 w-full z-50`
- Background: `bg-background/95 backdrop-blur-md`
- Border: `border-b border-border`

#### Navigation Links
- Hover: `hover:text-primary transition-colors`
- Active: Enhanced with underline or background

### Icons
- Size: `w-6 h-6` standard
- Color: Inherit from parent or specific theme color
- Hover effects: Scale and color transitions

## 🎭 Effects & Animations

### Glass Morphism
- Backdrop blur: `backdrop-blur-sm` or `backdrop-blur-md`
- Semi-transparent backgrounds: `bg-{color}/10` to `bg-{color}/20`
- Border: `border border-{color}/20`

### Hover Effects
- **Scale**: `.hover-scale-sm` - Scales to 105%
- **Lift**: `.hover-lift` - Translates up by 4px
- **Glow**: `.hover-glow` - Enhanced shadow on hover
- **Button Animation**: `.btn-animate` - Smooth all transitions

### Transitions
- **All Smooth**: `.transition-all-smooth` - `transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1)`
- **Transform**: `transition-transform duration-300`
- **Colors**: `transition-colors duration-300`

### Decorative Animations
- **Flower blobs**: `.animate-flower-1`, `.animate-flower-2`, `.animate-flower-3`
  - Floating/pulsing motion in hero section
  - Colors: Blue, lavender, light green, peach

### Focus States
- Ring: `focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-{color}`
- Outline: `focus-visible:outline-none`

## 📱 Responsive Design

### Breakpoints
- **sm**: 640px
- **md**: 768px
- **lg**: 1024px
- **xl**: 1280px

### Responsive Patterns
```css
/* Mobile-first approach */
.element {
  padding: 1rem;        /* Mobile */
}

@media (min-width: 768px) {
  .element {
    padding: 1.5rem;    /* Tablet */
  }
}

@media (min-width: 1024px) {
  .element {
    padding: 2rem;      /* Desktop */
  }
}
```

### Common Responsive Classes
- Text: `text-base md:text-lg lg:text-xl`
- Spacing: `p-4 md:p-6 lg:p-8`
- Grid: `grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3`

## ♿ Accessibility

### ARIA Labels
- All interactive elements have descriptive `aria-label` attributes
- Navigation uses `role="navigation"`
- Sections use appropriate landmark roles

### Focus Management
- Visible focus states on all interactive elements
- Keyboard navigation support (arrow keys in modals)
- Skip links for screen readers

### Color Contrast
- All text meets WCAG AA standards (minimum 4.5:1 ratio)
- Deep forest green (`hsl(158, 85%, 9%)`) provides excellent contrast on light backgrounds

### Semantic HTML
- Proper heading hierarchy (h1 → h2 → h3 → h4)
- Semantic section elements with IDs
- Lists use proper `<ul>` and `<li>` tags

