## 📋 Best Practices

### Component Usage
1. Always use Button component from UI library
2. Apply theme-specific classes to match section context
3. Use glass effects for elevated surfaces
4. Include hover effects on interactive elements

### Color Usage
1. Stick to defined color palette
2. Use theme colors in their respective sections
3. Ensure sufficient contrast for readability
4. Apply opacity for subtle backgrounds (`/10`, `/20`, `/60`)

### Spacing
1. Use consistent padding across sections (`py-20`)
2. Maintain grid gaps (`gap-6` or `gap-8`)
3. Apply responsive spacing with breakpoint modifiers

### Accessibility
1. Always include ARIA labels for icons and interactive elements
2. Test keyboard navigation
3. Ensure color contrast meets standards
4. Use semantic HTML elements

